OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F362A1785093508
OL,3,CTeenager seriously injured in e-
OL,4,Cscooter crash
OL,6,FA 17-year old girl is in a serious
OL,7,Fcondition in hospital after an e-
OL,8,Fscooter crash in Liverpool.
OL,10,FPolice are appealing for information
OL,11,Fabout the collision involving a van
OL,12,Fand an e-scooter in the city centre in
OL,13,Fthe early hours of Sunday 26th July.
OL,15,FPolice received a report at 1.20 a.m.
OL,16,Fthat two 17-year-old girls riding an e-
OL,17,Fscooter had been involved in a
OL,18,Fcollision with a Mercedes Vito on
OL,19,FGreat George Street.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/6
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
