OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,363,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36202
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F362A1785093508
OL,3,CTeenager seriously injured in e-
OL,4,Cscooter crash
OL,6,FEmergency services attended the scene
OL,7,Fand one of the girls was taken to
OL,8,Fhospital where she remains in a
OL,9,Fcritical condition.
OL,11,FThe second teenager was arrested on
OL,12,Fsuspicion of causing serious injury by
OL,13,Fdangerous driving, drug driving and
OL,14,Fdriving without insurance.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/6
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,363,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36203
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F362A1785093508
OL,3,CTeenager seriously injured in e-
OL,4,Cscooter crash
OL,6,FThe driver of the Mercedes Vito failed
OL,7,Fto stop at the scene, but following
OL,8,Fenquiries the vehicle was located
OL,9,Fnearby and a 57-year-old man from
OL,10,FLiverpool was arrested on suspicion of
OL,11,Fcausing serious injury by careless
OL,12,Fdriving and failing to stop.
OL,14,FDetective Sergeant Simon Duffy from
OL,15,Fthe Matrix Serious Collision
OL,16,FInvestigation Unit said: "This was a
OL,17,Fvery serious collision that has
OL,18,Fresulted in a teenage girl in hospital
OL,19,Fwhere she is currently in a critical
OL,20,Fcondition.
OL,26,@xD@ZOU
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/6
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,363,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36204
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F362A1785093508
OL,3,CTeenager seriously injured in e-
OL,4,Cscooter crash
OL,6,F"As part of our initial inquiries, we
OL,7,Fhave arrested two people and they both
OL,8,Fremain in custody where they will be
OL,9,Fquestioned about their possible
OL,10,Finvolvement.
OL,26,@nD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G4/6
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,363,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36205
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F362A1785093508
OL,3,CTeenager seriously injured in e-
OL,4,Cscooter crash
OL,6,F"In the meantime, I'd like to take
OL,7,Fthis opportunity to appeal to any
OL,8,Fpossible witnesses. We know this
OL,9,Fhappened very early this morning, but
OL,10,Fif anyone saw what occurred or were
OL,11,Fdriving through the area just before
OL,12,Fthe incident, then please get in
OL,13,Ftouch. I would also ask anyone who
OL,14,Ftravelled through other parts of the
OL,15,Fcity and saw two girls on an e-scooter
OL,16,Fto let us know.
OL,26,@nD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G5/6
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,363,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36206
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F362A1785093508
OL,3,CTeenager seriously injured in e-
OL,4,Cscooter crash
OL,6,F"Similarly, if you live or work in the
OL,7,Farea and have CCTV or smart doorbell
OL,8,Ffootage, please take a moment to
OL,9,Freview to see if you captured anything
OL,10,Fthat could assist our investigation.
OL,11,FEven the smallest of details could be
OL,12,Fvital, so please don't hesitate to get
OL,13,Fin touch and let our team review your
OL,14,Ffootage."
OL,16,FAnyone who witnessed the collision or
OL,17,Fcaptured the incident on CCTV or
OL,18,Fdashcam is asked to contact the police
OL,19,Fon (0151) 777 5747, or email
OL,20,FSCIU@merseyside.police.uk quoting
OL,21,Fincident reference 072 of 26 July.
OL,26,@nD@AOUvD@IO]
